-shiji-043-zhao:p042","quote":"其後娶空同氏，生五子。襄子爲伯魯之不立也，不肯立子，且必欲傳位與伯魯子代成君。成君先死，乃取代成君子浣立爲太子。襄子立三十三年卒，浣立，是爲獻侯。"}],"rationale":"限本篇連續敘事、是為、諡稱及明示親屬語境。周舍／周捨按諫臣同段暫接；兩位周、中山武公與趙武公、子朝與趙朝分開。圍鄭晉陽知伯與較早知伯文子仍分候選，不因同爵或熟知姓名合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p042","text":"其後娶空同氏，生五子。襄子爲伯魯之不立也，不肯立子，且必欲傳位與伯魯子代成君。成君先死，乃取代成君子浣立爲太子。襄子立三十三年卒，浣立，是爲獻侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m042-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"空同氏","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002342","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m042-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"五子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、未定指代與神異預言分存；不按地名、先後繼位或熟知身份補世系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m042-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"襄子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002306","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m042-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"伯魯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002308","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m042-0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、未定指代與神異預言分存；不按地名、先後繼位或熟知身份補世系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m042-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"伯魯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002308","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m042-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、未定指代與神異預言分存；不按地名、先後繼位或熟知身份補世系。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m042-0035","start":35,"end":38,"surface":"代成君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002336","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m042-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"成君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002336","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m042-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"代成君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002336",